    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players explore the world through the perspectives of two individuals, each with their own unique experiences, as they navigate their daily lives in a world where public transportation is free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Man's Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of his monotonous life, the player decides to earn some quick cash by taking part in a venue survey. But just when he\u2019s had enough of his dull routine, he unexpectedly runs into an old friend. Invited over to his friend\u2019s house, he meets the friend\u2019s girlfriend\u2014 and that\u2019s when things take a wild turn. What seemed like a casual meeting suddenly drags the player into an unexpected and life-changing event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Woman's Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of a team working on autonomous car brake systems, the player is right in the middle of cutting-edge technology. But one day, an unforeseen accident leaves her critically injured, teetering on the edge of life and death. She's offered a radical solution: a surgery that transfers only her brain into another body. When she wakes up, she finds herself in a whole new world\u2014but what awaits her there? And what fate lies ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A world where public transportation is free. However, the price for this convenience is that you must endure endless, mind-numbing ads just to travel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a future where anyone can easily print another person's face with a 3D printer, what kind of hopes and despair await?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In organ transplants, compatibility with the donor is crucial. However, when the genetic closeness is too high, a strange irony can occur \u2014 the recipient may instinctively reject a part of their own body.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cars equipped with an automatic braking system. Have you ever wondered how the algorithm behind it really works?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players explore the world through the perspectives of two individuals, each with their own unique experiences, as they navigate their daily lives in a world where public transportation is free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Man's Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of his monotonous life, the player decides to earn some quick cash by taking part in a venue survey. But just when he\u2019s had enough of his dull routine, he unexpectedly runs into an old friend. Invited over to his friend\u2019s house, he meets the friend\u2019s girlfriend\u2014 and that\u2019s when things take a wild turn. What seemed like a casual meeting suddenly drags the player into an unexpected and life-changing event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Woman's Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of a team working on autonomous car brake systems, the player is right in the middle of cutting-edge technology. But one day, an unforeseen accident leaves her critically injured, teetering on the edge of life and death. She's offered a radical solution: a surgery that transfers only her brain into another body. When she wakes up, she finds herself in a whole new world\u2014but what awaits her there? And what fate lies ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/105becaacf58485fa496760b76c81387.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A world where public transportation is free. However, the price for this convenience is that you must endure endless, mind-numbing ads just to travel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/b8712229931cde95f452d40dbbb75fd4.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a future where anyone can easily print another person's face with a 3D printer, what kind of hopes and despair await?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/9e31cd09c16eaffd9266e0d291c87fde.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In organ transplants, compatibility with the donor is crucial. However, when the genetic closeness is too high, a strange irony can occur \u2014 the recipient may instinctively reject a part of their own body.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.poster.avif?t=1754622893\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.webm?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/extras/ed73b57ba17916703fb6d29f01ecd4bc.mp4?t=1754622893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cars equipped with an automatic braking system. Have you ever wondered how the algorithm behind it really works?</i></p>",
